            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-87862",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "curl: curl: HSTS cache import drops longer-lived child"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in curl. When importing HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS) cache records, loading a parent domain entry configured to include subdomains before a longer-lived subdomain entry silently drops the subdomain policy. Consequently, once the parent policy expires, curl fails to upgrade subsequent connections for the subdomain to HTTPS and transmits unencrypted requests, allowing a network attacker to intercept sensitive data."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-87862",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-87862\nSeverity: LOW\nPackage: libcurl4t64\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-87862](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-87862)\nA flaw was found in curl. When importing HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS) cache records, loading a parent domain entry configured to include subdomains before a longer-lived subdomain entry silently drops the subdomain policy. Consequently, once the parent policy expires, curl fails to upgrade subsequent connections for the subdomain to HTTPS and transmits unencrypted requests, allowing a network attacker to intercept sensitive data.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-87862**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|LOW|libcurl4t64||[CVE-2026-87862](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-87862)|\n\nA flaw was found in curl. When importing HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS) cache records, loading a parent domain entry configured to include subdomains before a longer-lived subdomain entry silently drops the subdomain policy. Consequently, once the parent policy expires, curl fails to upgrade subsequent connections for the subdomain to HTTPS and transmits unencrypted requests, allowing a network attacker to intercept sensitive data."
              },
