              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "curl: curl: curl_mime_free stack overflow by recursion"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in curl. An attacker could supply deeply nested Multipurpose Internet Mail Extensions (MIME) structures to an application utilizing the libcurl library. During memory cleanup in the curl_mime_free function, excessive recursive calls exhaust available stack memory, leading to an application crash and a Denial of Service (DoS)."
              },
