              "id": "CVE-2026-80692",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: Bluetooth: hci_sync: hold conn in hci_connect_acl/le_sync() callbacks"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: hci_sync: hold conn in hci_connect_acl/le_sync() callbacks\n\nThere is theoretical UAF if the conn is freed while the hci_sync task\nis running.\n\nHold refcount to avoid that."
              },
