                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-93817**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-93817](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-93817)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nperf: Fix addr_filter_ranges lifetime\n\nLee Jia Jie reported that since event::addr_filter_ranges is used\nunder RCU, it should be RCU freed."
