            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-97429",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/amdkfd: fix UAF race in destroy_queue_cpsch"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amdkfd: fix UAF race in destroy_queue_cpsch\n\nwait_on_destroy_queue() drops locks to wait for queue resume, allowing\na concurrent destroy to free the queue. Use is_being_destroyed flag to\nserialize destruction."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-97429",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-97429\nSeverity: HIGH\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-97429](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-97429)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amdkfd: fix UAF race in destroy_queue_cpsch\n\nwait_on_destroy_queue() drops locks to wait for queue resume, allowing\na concurrent destroy to free the queue. Use is_being_destroyed flag to\nserialize destruction.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-97429**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-97429](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-97429)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amdkfd: fix UAF race in destroy_queue_cpsch\n\nwait_on_destroy_queue() drops locks to wait for queue resume, allowing\na concurrent destroy to free the queue. Use is_being_destroyed flag to\nserialize destruction."
