            {
              "id": "CVE-2016-8660",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: xfs: local DoS due to a page lock order bug in the XFS seek hole/data implementation"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The XFS subsystem in the Linux kernel through 4.8.2 allows local users to cause a denial of service (fdatasync failure and system hang) by using the vfs syscall group in the trinity program, related to a \"page lock order bug in the XFS seek hole/data implementation.\""
              },
