            {
              "id": "CVE-2022-50380",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: mm: /proc/pid/smaps_rollup: fix no vma's null-deref"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmm: /proc/pid/smaps_rollup: fix no vma's null-deref\n\nCommit 258f669e7e88 (\"mm: /proc/pid/smaps_rollup: convert to single value\nseq_file\") introduced a null-deref if there are no vma's in the task in\nshow_smaps_rollup."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2022-50380",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2022-50380\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2022-50380](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2022-50380)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmm: /proc/pid/smaps_rollup: fix no vma's null-deref\n\nCommit 258f669e7e88 (\"mm: /proc/pid/smaps_rollup: convert to single value\nseq_file\") introduced a null-deref if there are no vma's in the task in\nshow_smaps_rollup.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2022-50380**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2022-50380](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2022-50380)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmm: /proc/pid/smaps_rollup: fix no vma's null-deref\n\nCommit 258f669e7e88 (\"mm: /proc/pid/smaps_rollup: convert to single value\nseq_file\") introduced a null-deref if there are no vma's in the task in\nshow_smaps_rollup."
              },
              "properties": {
