                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2023-26242**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2023-26242](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2023-26242)|\n\nafu_mmio_region_get_by_offset in drivers/fpga/dfl-afu-region.c in the Linux kernel through 6.1.12 has an integer overflow."
