                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-49990**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2024-49990](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-49990)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/xe/hdcp: Check GSC structure validity\n\nSometimes xe_gsc is not initialized when checked at HDCP capability\ncheck. Add gsc structure check to avoid null pointer error."
