            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-58241",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: Kernel: Bluetooth HCI local DoS"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: hci_core: Disable works on hci_unregister_dev\n\nThis make use of disable_work_* on hci_unregister_dev since the hci_dev is\nabout to be freed new submissions are not disarable."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-58241",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-58241\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2024-58241](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-58241)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: hci_core: Disable works on hci_unregister_dev\n\nThis make use of disable_work_* on hci_unregister_dev since the hci_dev is\nabout to be freed new submissions are not disarable.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-58241**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2024-58241](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-58241)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: hci_core: Disable works on hci_unregister_dev\n\nThis make use of disable_work_* on hci_unregister_dev since the hci_dev is\nabout to be freed new submissions are not disarable."
              },
              "properties": {
