            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-39754",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: mm/smaps: fix race between smaps_hugetlb_range and migration"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmm/smaps: fix race between smaps_hugetlb_range and migration\n\nsmaps_hugetlb_range() handles the pte without holdling ptl, and may be\nconcurrenct with migration, leaing to BUG_ON in pfn_swap_entry_to_page(). \nThe race is as follows.\n\nsmaps_hugetlb_range              migrate_pages\n  huge_ptep_get\n                                   remove_migration_ptes\n\t\t\t\t   folio_unlock\n  pfn_swap_entry_folio\n    BUG_ON\n\nTo fix it, hold ptl lock in smaps_hugetlb_range()."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-39754",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-39754\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2025-39754](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-39754)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmm/smaps: fix race between smaps_hugetlb_range and migration\n\nsmaps_hugetlb_range() handles the pte without holdling ptl, and may be\nconcurrenct with migration, leaing to BUG_ON in pfn_swap_entry_to_page(). \nThe race is as follows.\n\nsmaps_hugetlb_range              migrate_pages\n  huge_ptep_get\n                                   remove_migration_ptes\n\t\t\t\t   folio_unlock\n  pfn_swap_entry_folio\n    BUG_ON\n\nTo fix it, hold ptl lock in smaps_hugetlb_range().",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-39754**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2025-39754](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-39754)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmm/smaps: fix race between smaps_hugetlb_range and migration\n\nsmaps_hugetlb_range() handles the pte without holdling ptl, and may be\nconcurrenct with migration, leaing to BUG_ON in pfn_swap_entry_to_page(). \nThe race is as follows.\n\nsmaps_hugetlb_range              migrate_pages\n  huge_ptep_get\n                                   remove_migration_ptes\n\t\t\t\t   folio_unlock\n  pfn_swap_entry_folio\n    BUG_ON\n\nTo fix it, hold ptl lock in smaps_hugetlb_range()."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
