            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-40354",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: Linux kernel: Privilege escalation in AMD display driver"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: increase max link count and fix link-\u003eenc NULL pointer access\n\n[why]\n1.) dc-\u003elinks[MAX_LINKS] array size smaller than actual requested.\nmax_connector + max_dpia + 4 virtual = 14.\nincrease from 12 to 14.\n\n2.) hw_init() access null LINK_ENC for dpia non display_endpoint.\n\n(cherry picked from commit d7f5a61e1b04ed87b008c8d327649d184dc5bb45)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-40354",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-40354\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2025-40354](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-40354)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: increase max link count and fix link-\u003eenc NULL pointer access\n\n[why]\n1.) dc-\u003elinks[MAX_LINKS] array size smaller than actual requested.\nmax_connector + max_dpia + 4 virtual = 14.\nincrease from 12 to 14.\n\n2.) hw_init() access null LINK_ENC for dpia non display_endpoint.\n\n(cherry picked from commit d7f5a61e1b04ed87b008c8d327649d184dc5bb45)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-40354**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2025-40354](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-40354)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: increase max link count and fix link-\u003eenc NULL pointer access\n\n[why]\n1.) dc-\u003elinks[MAX_LINKS] array size smaller than actual requested.\nmax_connector + max_dpia + 4 virtual = 14.\nincrease from 12 to 14.\n\n2.) hw_init() access null LINK_ENC for dpia non display_endpoint.\n\n(cherry picked from commit d7f5a61e1b04ed87b008c8d327649d184dc5bb45)"
              },
