                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-64060**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-64060](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-64060)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnetfs: Fix leak of request in netfs_write_begin() error handling\n\nFix netfs_write_begin() to not leak our ref on the request in the event\nthat we get an error from netfs_wait_for_read()."
