            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-68383",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/xe/guc: Keep scheduler timeline name alive"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/xe/guc: Keep scheduler timeline name alive\n\nThe scheduler keeps a pointer to the timeline name, but q-\u003ename\nis freed with the exec queue while scheduler fences can still\nreference it.\n\nStore the name in struct xe_guc_exec_queue so it shares\nthe scheduler's RCU-deferred lifetime.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 41075f0eb5dcbd3b065d15f15ef7bbe9315188e8)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-68383",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-68383\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-68383](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-68383)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/xe/guc: Keep scheduler timeline name alive\n\nThe scheduler keeps a pointer to the timeline name, but q-\u003ename\nis freed with the exec queue while scheduler fences can still\nreference it.\n\nStore the name in struct xe_guc_exec_queue so it shares\nthe scheduler's RCU-deferred lifetime.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 41075f0eb5dcbd3b065d15f15ef7bbe9315188e8)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-68383**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-68383](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-68383)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/xe/guc: Keep scheduler timeline name alive\n\nThe scheduler keeps a pointer to the timeline name, but q-\u003ename\nis freed with the exec queue while scheduler fences can still\nreference it.\n\nStore the name in struct xe_guc_exec_queue so it shares\nthe scheduler's RCU-deferred lifetime.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 41075f0eb5dcbd3b065d15f15ef7bbe9315188e8)"
              },
