              "id": "CVE-2026-72499",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: RDMA/bnxt_re: Free CQ toggle page after firmware teardown"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nRDMA/bnxt_re: Free CQ toggle page after firmware teardown\n\nFree the toggle page only after firmware teardown completes so that\nan NQ interrupt arriving during bnxt_qplib_destroy_cq() won't write\nthe toggle value to an already-freed page. Move free_page() after\nbnxt_qplib_destroy_cq."
              },
