                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-74531**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-74531](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-74531)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: hci_conn: hold conn reference in abort_conn_sync()\n\nThere is theoretical UAF if the conn is freed while the hci_sync task is\nrunning.\n\nHold refcount to avoid that."
