            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-74541",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: Bluetooth: ISO: clear iso_data always when detaching conn from hcon"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: ISO: clear iso_data always when detaching conn from hcon\n\nWhen setting conn-\u003ehcon = NULL, also conn-\u003ehcon-\u003eiso_data = NULL is\nnecessary, otherwise later iso_conn_free() will UAF.\n\nFix clearing of iso_data in iso_sock_disconn()\n\nFixes KASAN: slab-use-after-free in iso_conn_hold_unless_zero on\niso_sock_release() followed by hci_abort_conn_sync()."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-74541",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-74541\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-74541](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-74541)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: ISO: clear iso_data always when detaching conn from hcon\n\nWhen setting conn-\u003ehcon = NULL, also conn-\u003ehcon-\u003eiso_data = NULL is\nnecessary, otherwise later iso_conn_free() will UAF.\n\nFix clearing of iso_data in iso_sock_disconn()\n\nFixes KASAN: slab-use-after-free in iso_conn_hold_unless_zero on\niso_sock_release() followed by hci_abort_conn_sync().",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-74541**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-74541](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-74541)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: ISO: clear iso_data always when detaching conn from hcon\n\nWhen setting conn-\u003ehcon = NULL, also conn-\u003ehcon-\u003eiso_data = NULL is\nnecessary, otherwise later iso_conn_free() will UAF.\n\nFix clearing of iso_data in iso_sock_disconn()\n\nFixes KASAN: slab-use-after-free in iso_conn_hold_unless_zero on\niso_sock_release() followed by hci_abort_conn_sync()."
              },
