            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-74693",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: net: prestera: validate firmware header length"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnet: prestera: validate firmware header length\n\nprestera_fw_hdr_parse() reads the firmware header before checking\nthat the firmware image contains that header.\n\nReject images shorter than struct prestera_fw_header before decoding the\nmagic and version fields."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-74693",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-74693\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-74693](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-74693)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnet: prestera: validate firmware header length\n\nprestera_fw_hdr_parse() reads the firmware header before checking\nthat the firmware image contains that header.\n\nReject images shorter than struct prestera_fw_header before decoding the\nmagic and version fields.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-74693**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-74693](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-74693)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnet: prestera: validate firmware header length\n\nprestera_fw_hdr_parse() reads the firmware header before checking\nthat the firmware image contains that header.\n\nReject images shorter than struct prestera_fw_header before decoding the\nmagic and version fields."
              },
