            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-80540",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/amdgpu: Fix UVD decode image min size calculation"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amdgpu: Fix UVD decode image min size calculation\n\nThis needs to use pitch instead of width. Also reject pitch\nover 4096 to avoid overflow.\n\n(cherry picked from commit b41c8cb12e202b220353332ab87dc01a11f69304)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-80540",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-80540\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-80540](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-80540)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amdgpu: Fix UVD decode image min size calculation\n\nThis needs to use pitch instead of width. Also reject pitch\nover 4096 to avoid overflow.\n\n(cherry picked from commit b41c8cb12e202b220353332ab87dc01a11f69304)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-80540**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-80540](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-80540)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amdgpu: Fix UVD decode image min size calculation\n\nThis needs to use pitch instead of width. Also reject pitch\nover 4096 to avoid overflow.\n\n(cherry picked from commit b41c8cb12e202b220353332ab87dc01a11f69304)"
