              "id": "CVE-2026-80694",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: net: ethernet: mtk_eth_soc: pass eth to mtk_handle_irq_rx in poll_controller"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnet: ethernet: mtk_eth_soc: pass eth to mtk_handle_irq_rx in poll_controller\n\nmtk_handle_irq_rx expects a struct mtk_eth * (matching the request_irq\ncookie), but mtk_poll_controller incorrectly passed the net_device *.\nCalling ndo_poll_controller with CONFIG_NET_POLL_CONTROLLER enabled\nwould then crash."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-80694",
              "help": {
