                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-80878**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-80878](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-80878)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nafs: Fix leak of ungot volume\n\nFix afs_lookup_volume_rcu() so that it doesn't leak a dying volume if\nafs_try_get_volume() fails."
