            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-89832",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  f ..."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nf2fs: fix to clear dirty flag on folio in error path\n\nIf node block is corrupted due to chksum mismatch or inconsistent\nfooter info, it needs to drop clear flag of node folio, in order\nto persist inconsistent node data to storage."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-89832",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-89832\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-89832](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-89832)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nf2fs: fix to clear dirty flag on folio in error path\n\nIf node block is corrupted due to chksum mismatch or inconsistent\nfooter info, it needs to drop clear flag of node folio, in order\nto persist inconsistent node data to storage.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-89832**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-89832](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-89832)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nf2fs: fix to clear dirty flag on folio in error path\n\nIf node block is corrupted due to chksum mismatch or inconsistent\nfooter info, it needs to drop clear flag of node folio, in order\nto persist inconsistent node data to storage."
