            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-89868",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  m ..."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmedia: chips-media: wave5: Add timeout while stop_streaming\n\nWhen stop_streaming is called, an infinite loop may occur in some cases.\nAdd a bounded poll of the queue status: loop until the queues drain,\nsleeping briefly between polls, and bail out once VPU_DEC_STOP_TIMEOUT\nelapses."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-89868",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-89868\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-89868](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-89868)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmedia: chips-media: wave5: Add timeout while stop_streaming\n\nWhen stop_streaming is called, an infinite loop may occur in some cases.\nAdd a bounded poll of the queue status: loop until the queues drain,\nsleeping briefly between polls, and bail out once VPU_DEC_STOP_TIMEOUT\nelapses.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-89868**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-89868](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-89868)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmedia: chips-media: wave5: Add timeout while stop_streaming\n\nWhen stop_streaming is called, an infinite loop may occur in some cases.\nAdd a bounded poll of the queue status: loop until the queues drain,\nsleeping briefly between polls, and bail out once VPU_DEC_STOP_TIMEOUT\nelapses."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
