            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-90166",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: smb/server: fix null-ptr-deref in ksmbd_ipc_tree_connect_request()"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nsmb/server: fix null-ptr-deref in ksmbd_ipc_tree_connect_request()\n\nSee the procedure below:\n\n  ksmbd_tree_conn_connect\n    ksmbd_share_config_get\n      share-\u003ename = kstrdup() // fail\n      if (!test_share_config_flag(share, KSMBD_SHARE_FLAG_PIPE)) // false\n      // do not check `share-\u003ename`\n    ksmbd_ipc_tree_connect_request\n      strlen(share-\u003ename) // null-ptr-deref"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-90166",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-90166\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-90166](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-90166)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nsmb/server: fix null-ptr-deref in ksmbd_ipc_tree_connect_request()\n\nSee the procedure below:\n\n  ksmbd_tree_conn_connect\n    ksmbd_share_config_get\n      share-\u003ename = kstrdup() // fail\n      if (!test_share_config_flag(share, KSMBD_SHARE_FLAG_PIPE)) // false\n      // do not check `share-\u003ename`\n    ksmbd_ipc_tree_connect_request\n      strlen(share-\u003ename) // null-ptr-deref",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-90166**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-90166](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-90166)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nsmb/server: fix null-ptr-deref in ksmbd_ipc_tree_connect_request()\n\nSee the procedure below:\n\n  ksmbd_tree_conn_connect\n    ksmbd_share_config_get\n      share-\u003ename = kstrdup() // fail\n      if (!test_share_config_flag(share, KSMBD_SHARE_FLAG_PIPE)) // false\n      // do not check `share-\u003ename`\n    ksmbd_ipc_tree_connect_request\n      strlen(share-\u003ename) // null-ptr-deref"
              },
