                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-90298**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-90298](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-90298)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/sun4i: tcon: Drop TCON TOP device reference\n\nof_find_device_by_node() takes a device reference. Drop it after mux\nconfiguration succeeds."
