            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-93046",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  s ..."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nsoftware node: Fix software_node_get_reference_args() with index -1\n\nThe bounds check for the index passed to\nsoftware_node_get_reference_args() was failing when passed UINT_MAX,\nthis in turn would lead to an out of bound access in the property\narray. Fix the bound check to also cover the UINT_MAX case."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-93046",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-93046\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-93046](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-93046)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nsoftware node: Fix software_node_get_reference_args() with index -1\n\nThe bounds check for the index passed to\nsoftware_node_get_reference_args() was failing when passed UINT_MAX,\nthis in turn would lead to an out of bound access in the property\narray. Fix the bound check to also cover the UINT_MAX case.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-93046**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-93046](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-93046)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nsoftware node: Fix software_node_get_reference_args() with index -1\n\nThe bounds check for the index passed to\nsoftware_node_get_reference_args() was failing when passed UINT_MAX,\nthis in turn would lead to an out of bound access in the property\narray. Fix the bound check to also cover the UINT_MAX case."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
