                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-93126**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-93126](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-93126)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nremoteproc: qcom_q6v5_adsp: Fix reference leak for device node\n\nWhen calling of_parse_phandle_with_args(), the caller is responsible\nto call of_node_put() to release the reference of device node.\nIn adsp_map_carveout, it does not release the reference."
