                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-93244**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-93244](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-93244)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/sysfb: simpledrm: Improve stride validation\n\nValidate the computed stride against the maximum value INT_MAX."
