              "id": "CVE-2026-93791",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: wifi: iwlwifi: mvm: add a check on the tid coming from the firmware"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: iwlwifi: mvm: add a check on the tid coming from the firmware\n\nba_notif-\u003etid is a firmware-controlled u8 that is used directly\nas an array index into tid_data[] without any validation. Add a\nbounds check against IWL_MAX_TID_COUNT before dereferencing the\narray."
              },
