            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-97500",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: wifi: rtw89: phy: check length before parsing PHY status IE"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: rtw89: phy: check length before parsing PHY status IE\n\nHardware might report PHY status IE with unexpected length, and parser\nmight access out of range. Check the length ahead."
