              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: thunderbolt: Keep XDomain reference during the lifetime of a service"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nthunderbolt: Keep XDomain reference during the lifetime of a service\n\nThis is needed because we release the service ID in tb_service_release()\nand the ID array is owned by the parent XDomain."
