                "text": "kernel: mptcp: fix bad accounting in __mptcp_subflow_push_pending()"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmptcp: fix bad accounting in __mptcp_subflow_push_pending()\n\nIf __subflow_push_pending() errors out we should avoid updating the\ncopied byte counters, to avoid mismatch push call later on."
              },
