            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-97899",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/i915: Fix memory leak in query_perf_config_list()"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/i915: Fix memory leak in query_perf_config_list()\n\nWhen krealloc() fails, free the original oa_config_ids before returning\nto avoid a memory leak.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 9977e9d84f46d4f12ad35fbbc0ec4638554bce87)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-97899",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-97899\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-97899](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-97899)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/i915: Fix memory leak in query_perf_config_list()\n\nWhen krealloc() fails, free the original oa_config_ids before returning\nto avoid a memory leak.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 9977e9d84f46d4f12ad35fbbc0ec4638554bce87)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-97899**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-97899](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-97899)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/i915: Fix memory leak in query_perf_config_list()\n\nWhen krealloc() fails, free the original oa_config_ids before returning\nto avoid a memory leak.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 9977e9d84f46d4f12ad35fbbc0ec4638554bce87)"
