                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-98203**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-98203](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-98203)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nInput: soc_button_array - check btns_desc-\u003epackage.count\n\nCheck that btns_desc-\u003epackage.count is not 0 before accessing\nbtns_desc-\u003epackage.elements[0]."
