                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2023-54190**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|LOW|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2023-54190](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2023-54190)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nleds: led-core: Fix refcount leak in of_led_get()\n\nclass_find_device_by_of_node() calls class_find_device(), it will take\nthe reference, use the put_device() to drop the reference when not need\nanymore."
