                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-39789**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|LOW|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2025-39789](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-39789)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ncrypto: x86/aegis - Add missing error checks\n\nThe skcipher_walk functions can allocate memory and can fail, so\nchecking for errors is necessary."
