              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-43308",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-43308\nSeverity: LOW\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-43308](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-43308)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nbtrfs: don't BUG() on unexpected delayed ref type in run_one_delayed_ref()\n\nThere is no need to BUG(), we can just return an error and log an error\nmessage.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-43308**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|LOW|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-43308](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-43308)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nbtrfs: don't BUG() on unexpected delayed ref type in run_one_delayed_ref()\n\nThere is no need to BUG(), we can just return an error and log an error\nmessage."
