              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nntb: Store original DMA address for future release\n\nThe DMA API requires that dma_free_attrs receive the exact dma_handle\noriginally returned by the allocation function. Do not modify it."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-80884",
