            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-90084",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: octeontx2-vf: fix workqueue and netdev race in probe/remove"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nocteontx2-vf: fix workqueue and netdev race in probe/remove\n\nInitialize the VF workqueue before register_netdev() so ndo_set_rx_mode\ndoes not queue work on a NULL workqueue. Unregister the netdev before\ndestroying the workqueue, and add proper probe error cleanup."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-90084",
