            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-90421",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:  P ..."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nPCI: Fix UAF when probe runs concurrent to dyn ID removal\n\nDynamic IDs are only guaranteed to be valid when dynids.lock is held,\nas remove_id_store() can free the node. Thus, make a copy in\npci_match_device(). Also, clarify that the id parameter is only valid\nduring probe."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-90421",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-90421\nSeverity: LOW\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-90421](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-90421)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nPCI: Fix UAF when probe runs concurrent to dyn ID removal\n\nDynamic IDs are only guaranteed to be valid when dynids.lock is held,\nas remove_id_store() can free the node. Thus, make a copy in\npci_match_device(). Also, clarify that the id parameter is only valid\nduring probe.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-90421**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|LOW|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-90421](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-90421)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nPCI: Fix UAF when probe runs concurrent to dyn ID removal\n\nDynamic IDs are only guaranteed to be valid when dynids.lock is held,\nas remove_id_store() can free the node. Thus, make a copy in\npci_match_device(). Also, clarify that the id parameter is only valid\nduring probe."
              },
              "properties": {
