            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-93285",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: f2fs: embed f2fs_gc_kthread in f2fs_sb_info"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nf2fs: embed f2fs_gc_kthread in f2fs_sb_info\n\nInstead of allocating f2fs_gc_kthread dynamically, embed it in\nf2fs_sb_info. This simplifies lifetime management and prepares for\nfixing race conditions during teardown.\n\n- __sbi_store\t\t\t- remount|shutdown\n\t\t\t\t - f2fs_stop_gc_thread\n - access sbi-\u003egc_thread\n\t\t\t\t  - sbi-\u003egc_thread = NULL\n - access sbi-\u003egc_thread-\u003ef2fs_gc_task"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-93285",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-93285\nSeverity: LOW\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-93285](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-93285)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nf2fs: embed f2fs_gc_kthread in f2fs_sb_info\n\nInstead of allocating f2fs_gc_kthread dynamically, embed it in\nf2fs_sb_info. This simplifies lifetime management and prepares for\nfixing race conditions during teardown.\n\n- __sbi_store\t\t\t- remount|shutdown\n\t\t\t\t - f2fs_stop_gc_thread\n - access sbi-\u003egc_thread\n\t\t\t\t  - sbi-\u003egc_thread = NULL\n - access sbi-\u003egc_thread-\u003ef2fs_gc_task",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-93285**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|LOW|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-93285](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-93285)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nf2fs: embed f2fs_gc_kthread in f2fs_sb_info\n\nInstead of allocating f2fs_gc_kthread dynamically, embed it in\nf2fs_sb_info. This simplifies lifetime management and prepares for\nfixing race conditions during teardown.\n\n- __sbi_store\t\t\t- remount|shutdown\n\t\t\t\t - f2fs_stop_gc_thread\n - access sbi-\u003egc_thread\n\t\t\t\t  - sbi-\u003egc_thread = NULL\n - access sbi-\u003egc_thread-\u003ef2fs_gc_task"
              },
              "properties": {
