            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-93818",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: PCI: plda: Protect root bus removal with rescan lock"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nPCI: plda: Protect root bus removal with rescan lock\n\nHold the pci_rescan_remove_lock lock while stopping and removing a root bus\nto avoid racing with concurrent rescan or hotplug operations triggered via\nsysfs.  Such races may lead to use-after-free issues or system crashes.\n\n[bhelgaas: commit log]"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-93818",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-93818\nSeverity: LOW\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-93818](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-93818)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nPCI: plda: Protect root bus removal with rescan lock\n\nHold the pci_rescan_remove_lock lock while stopping and removing a root bus\nto avoid racing with concurrent rescan or hotplug operations triggered via\nsysfs.  Such races may lead to use-after-free issues or system crashes.\n\n[bhelgaas: commit log]",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-93818**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|LOW|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-93818](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-93818)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nPCI: plda: Protect root bus removal with rescan lock\n\nHold the pci_rescan_remove_lock lock while stopping and removing a root bus\nto avoid racing with concurrent rescan or hotplug operations triggered via\nsysfs.  Such races may lead to use-after-free issues or system crashes.\n\n[bhelgaas: commit log]"
              },
              "properties": {
