              "id": "CVE-2026-97431",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/amd/display: Avoid DPMS-on for phantom stream"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: Avoid DPMS-on for phantom stream\n\n[Why \u0026 How]\nCalling dc_update_planes_and_stream separately for stream and its\nphantom stream causes a NULL pointer dereference, since the phantom is\ndestroyed on the first call.\n\nSkip the call for phantom streams."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-97431",
              "help": {
