            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-97494",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/amdgpu: validate and share PSP fw_pri_buf copies via psp_copy_fw"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amdgpu: validate and share PSP fw_pri_buf copies via psp_copy_fw\n\nChange psp_copy_fw from void to int: return -ENODEV when drm_dev_enter\nfails, and -EINVAL when the image size is zero or larger than the\n1 MiB PSP private buffer.\n\nReplace open-coded memset/memcpy into fw_pri_buf with psp_copy_fw."
              },
