            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-97504",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: watchdog: lenovo_se10_wdt: Fix use-after-free and resource leak risk"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwatchdog: lenovo_se10_wdt: Fix use-after-free and resource leak risk\n\nReview by sashiko.dev highlighted potential use after free and resource\nleak instances.\n\nSet se10_pdev to null to prevent use after free\n\nRemove DMI call back and instead directly call\nse10_create_platform_device. Handle error cases appropriately"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-97504",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-97504\nSeverity: LOW\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-97504](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-97504)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwatchdog: lenovo_se10_wdt: Fix use-after-free and resource leak risk\n\nReview by sashiko.dev highlighted potential use after free and resource\nleak instances.\n\nSet se10_pdev to null to prevent use after free\n\nRemove DMI call back and instead directly call\nse10_create_platform_device. Handle error cases appropriately",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-97504**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|LOW|linux-libc-dev||[CVE-2026-97504](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-97504)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwatchdog: lenovo_se10_wdt: Fix use-after-free and resource leak risk\n\nReview by sashiko.dev highlighted potential use after free and resource\nleak instances.\n\nSet se10_pdev to null to prevent use after free\n\nRemove DMI call back and instead directly call\nse10_create_platform_device. Handle error cases appropriately"
              },
              "properties": {
