                "text": "Vulnerability GHSA-2g87-pp6c-29x5\nSeverity: HIGH\nPackage: aiohttp\nFixed Version: 3.14.4\nLink: [GHSA-2g87-pp6c-29x5](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-2g87-pp6c-29x5)\n### Summary\n\nMultiple cases were found where aiohttp could use excessive or unbounded memory, or excessive CPU consumption on attacker controlled requests.\n\n### Impact\n\nAn attacker could cause resource exhaustion through specially crafted requests.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability GHSA-2g87-pp6c-29x5**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|aiohttp|3.14.4|[GHSA-2g87-pp6c-29x5](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-2g87-pp6c-29x5)|\n\n### Summary\n\nMultiple cases were found where aiohttp could use excessive or unbounded memory, or excessive CPU consumption on attacker controlled requests.\n\n### Impact\n\nAn attacker could cause resource exhaustion through specially crafted requests."
              },
              "properties": {
